3
00:00:15,934 --> 00:00:24,986
You can spend hours searching, money moving around, and still not know whether the property is actually available — or who you're dealing with.

4
00:00:24,986 --> 00:00:28,000
That’s why we built NyumbaSearch.

5
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:35,710
A smarter way to discover properties, connect with the right people, and make the journey from searching to moving in much easier.

6
00:00:35,710 --> 00:00:40,592
Instead of jumping from post to post, search in one place.

7
00:00:40,592 --> 00:00:46,184
Explore properties by location, price, and what actually matters to you.

8
00:00:46,184 --> 00:00:55,039
See property details, compare options, view locations on the map, and connect directly with the people responsible for the property.

9
00:00:55,039 --> 00:01:02,065
