13
00:01:22,592 --> 00:01:32,184
From leases and units to rent collection, invoices, and tenant activity, property management becomes more organized and easier to follow.

14
00:01:32,184 --> 00:01:36,539
Moving into a home also comes with everything around the home.

15
00:01:36,539 --> 00:01:46,368
That’s where NyumbaSearch connects tenants and property owners with trusted service providers — from moving and maintenance to other essential home services.

16
00:01:46,368 --> 00:02:00,131
And because moving isn't only about finding a house, NyumbaSearch is building connections to financial services that can help customers make better-informed decisions around the costs and financial needs that come with housing.

17
00:02:00,131 --> 00:02:07,355
Whether you're looking for a home, managing one, living in one, or providing the services that keep homes running…

